      "starRating": 5,
      "reviewDate": "10 months ago",
      "localGuideInfo": "Local Guide · 504 reviews",
      "text": "A slow, steady stream flowed gently, and people gathered along the bank to catch small fish. The air was fresh and crisp, but we couldn’t go any farther—a herd of macaques blocked the path ahead. My wife, terrified of them, refused to go any further",
      "scrapedAt": "2026-03-23T07:10:53.847Z"
    },
    {
      "reviewId": "ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNkMjdHeWRBEAE",
      "authorName": "CK Cheong",
      "starRating": 5,
      "reviewDate": "2 years ago",
      "localGuideInfo": "Local Guide · 1.8K reviews",
      "text": "Beautiful stream in the Wulingyuan Scenic and Historic Interest Area. The stream stretches 7.5 km, flowing between steep grotesque peaks and luxuriant trees creating a fantastic hiking trail amidst the enchanting natural ecological environment.",
      "scrapedAt": "2026-03-23T07:10:53.849Z"
    },
    {
